NetHack-de is an attempt at a German translation of NetHack.

Currently there are binaries for Win32 and Linux available. They or
the source code to NetHack-de can be downloaded from
http://sourceforge.net/project/showfiles.php?group_id=191550&package_id=225265&release_id=582986


Changes
=======
 * alpha release of NetHack-de 3.4.2-20080309a
 * 50% of in-game texts translated
 * correct usage of translated artifacts
 * correct gender for gods
 * generalized attributive genitives

